# env.optional — paid/external services are optional; each has a keyless fallback that is the
# DEFAULT. Set a key only to upgrade coverage. The skill runs fully without any of these.

# --- Hostile-site rendering (last resort for sites Playwright can't render) ---
# If APIFY_API_TOKEN is set -> route a too-hostile site through an Apify rendering/extractor
# actor and screenshot. If not set -> default keyless path: extract_brand.mjs (Playwright render
# + hero screenshot) and sample_colors.py; if even Playwright is blocked, the agent asks the
# user for a screenshot/brand guidelines and samples that. Apify is the last resort, never required.
APIFY_API_TOKEN

# Robomotion Proxy (geo-targeting for region-locked sites) is a platform feature, not a
# user key — no env var. image-processing color sampling needs no external key.
